# Italian Plate No1 Expanded is a licensed retail family (Zetafonts), and this
# repo is public. The build inlines it as a base64 WOFF2 subset, so committing
# the font or any build output containing it would publish the font itself.
#
# Keep both out of version control. Drop the OTFs into tools/fonts/ to rebuild.
tools/fonts/
ff-pullman-post.html
ff-pullman-post-blue.html
